Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ready for School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's important because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,especially for parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,who have more than one child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,two or three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's always challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to try to fork out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that much expense at one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,$1,000 per capita income
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is in addition to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,about 13,000 others
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that typically benefit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,from our TTFS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and other MENDAKI schemes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,held them back.
